            Prepare sua empresa para o futuro com compliance automatizado e estratégia fiscal de alta performance.
          </p>

          {/* Botões de Ação */}
          <div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 justify-center items-center w-full">
            <a 
              href="#contact" 
              className="group relative w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-lg rounded-xl shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(37,99,235,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(37,99,235,0.5)] transition-all overflow-hidden"
            >
              <span className="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center">
                Análise de Risco Gratuita
                <IconArrowRight className="ml-2 w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" />
