I've crafted `public/send-email.php`, setting up the CORS headers for proper cross-origin requests. It handles JSON input validation, initializes a cURL request to my N8N webhook, and manages the cURL output and error codes. This includes the handling of successful and unsuccessful N8N webhook calls. The PHP script will send a response back to the React frontend, indicating either success or failure.


