I'm presently focusing on testing the PHP script, specifically its error handling and CORS implementation. I want to verify that the responses from the script, be it success or failure from the N8N webhook, are correctly relayed back to the React front end. Logging is now integrated for debugging. I'll check that the CORS headers are functioning as expected and I will also test the various edge cases, such as invalid JSON input.


